---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About ImageLab & Open-Source Credits | ImageLab"
  description="Learn how ImageLab delivers studio-grade MozJPEG, LibWebP, PDF, and on-device AI tools completely free inside your browser."
>
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 space-y-8 animate-fade-up">
    <header>
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-400 mb-2">About</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-zinc-950">
        Built for Speed & Privacy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-zinc-500 mt-2.5 leading-relaxed">
        ImageLab is a browser-native image and PDF studio designed so anyone can convert,
        compress, crop, watermark, and enhance photos without uploading private files to remote servers.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="studio-card rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-6 text-sm text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed">
      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-zinc-950">Why Browser-First Architecture?</h2>
        <p>
          Traditional online converters upload your personal IDs, exam signatures, and client
          photos to third-party servers. By running real C++/WebAssembly encoders and neural models
          inside background Web Workers, ImageLab keeps processing instant, free, and strictly private.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-zinc-950">Open-Source Credits & Licenses</h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500">
          ImageLab is made possible by outstanding open-source projects. Our public frontend source
          code is available on{' '}
          <a
            href="https://github.com/thethirdclasseditor-ship-it/imagelab-free"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-blue-600 font-semibold hover:underline"
          >
            GitHub
          </a>
          .
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-zinc-600 list-disc pl-5">
          <li><strong>@jsquash/jpeg (MozJPEG) & @jsquash/webp (LibWebP)</strong> — Apache-2.0 / BSD licenses</li>
          <li><strong>UPNG.js, JSZip, jsPDF & heic2any</strong> — MIT licenses</li>
          <li><strong>@huggingface/transformers & Swin2SR</strong> — Apache-2.0 license</li>
          <li>
            <strong>@imgly/background-removal</strong> — AGPL-3.0 license (complete client-side
            source code publicly available via our GitHub repository above)
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
